<h1 align="center">Anteroom</h1>

<p align="center">
  <strong>Private AI that actually does things.</strong>
</p>

<p align="center">
  Self-hosted AI gateway. Web UI + agentic CLI. Any LLM. No telemetry.<br>
  <code>pip install anteroom</code>
</p>

